# Task: Prepare Test Activity Template

## Objective
Create a simple test activity template that we'll use to validate backend storage.

## Template Requirements
- Name: "validate-backend-test-template"
- ID: "validate-backend-test-template"
- Category: "infrastructure"
- 2 simple tasks (to test task storage)
- 1 variable (to test variable handling)
- Basic validation (to test validation storage)

## Template Structure
```json
{
  "name": "Validate Backend Test Template",
  "description": "Simple template for backend validation testing",
  "category": "infrastructure",
  "version": 1,
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "task-1",
      "subagent": "general",
      "description": "First test task",
      "dependencies": [],
      "prompt": {
        "template": "Execute test task 1: {{testParam}}",
        "maxTokens": 1000,
        "compressionStrategy": "filter",
        "variables": [
          {
            "name": "testParam",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true,
            "description": "Test parameter"
          }
        ]
      },
      "validation": {
        "requiredPatterns": ["completed"],
        "commands": []
      },
      "retry": {
        "maxAttempts": 1,
        "strategy": "simple"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "task-2",
      "subagent": "general",
      "description": "Second test task",
      "dependencies": ["task-1"],
      "prompt": {
        "template": "Execute test task 2 after task 1",
        "maxTokens": 1000,
        "compressionStrategy": "filter",
        "variables": []
      },
      "validation": {
        "commands": []
      },
      "retry": {
        "maxAttempts": 1,
        "strategy": "simple"
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

