1. Create the template JSON file at: `./test-templates/validate-backend-test-template.json`
2. Output the file path for the next task

## Output Format
```json
{
  "templatePath": "./test-templates/validate-backend-test-template.json",
  "templateId": "validate-backend-test-template",
  "status": "created"
}
```

